DESCRIPTION >
    topup_events — verified on-chain top-ups. 1 row = 1 granted payment.
SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime `json:$.timestamp`,
    `wallet` String `json:$.wallet`,
    `chain` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.chain`,
    `token` String `json:$.token`,
    `usd` Float32 `json:$.usd`,
    `credits` UInt32 `json:$.credits`,
    `tokens_granted` UInt64 `json:$.tokens_granted`,
    `tx_marker` String `json:$.tx_marker`
ENGINE >
    MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY >
    timestamp, wallet
